\caption{\textbf{Single-Neuron Readout Polarity and Benchmark Pareto Frontier.} \textbf{(A)} Projection of individual intermediate neuron columns in L31 \texttt{mlp.down\_proj} ($[2560, 9216]$) onto the newline-vs-comma direction $v_{\texttt{\textbackslash n}} - v_{\texttt{,}}$. \textbf{(B)} Run-1 exact Recall frontier on \texttt{v1} vs.\ \texttt{v2.1}: both single-model weight edits (Ideas A, B, C) and dual-adapter surgeries (\texttt{Graft-18}, \texttt{SVD-Blend}) substantially improve over their parent baselines with \textbf{zero training steps}.}
